{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strip Miner takes the simple  loop of sandbox strip mining and turns it into a casual roguelike mining experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start every run just below the surface of a massive drill shaft, armed with your corporate-issued mining tool. Mine and deposit ores to afford items and upgrades to assist you.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don't forget to submit quota. Fail, and you will be forgotten. Succeed, and you receive a replenished corporate-issued tool, because only the best bots may continue digging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dev Note:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We're Team Morrow, a small group of college students just trying out this whole game dev thing. We really appreciate you for reading this, and maybe even checking out this little tech demo we made in our free-time. There's still a lot that needs to be done for Strip Miner, and we're here for it. Thank you again for checking out our page!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(p.s. Wishlist? :3)</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3785160?t=1748990664","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785160/0e37454f5e0c5a5b2940dc67fe59d1894f5d90bc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748990664","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785160/a80eede188f7b96a821633d5b0ddd0f03fd68adf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748990664","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785160/a80eede188f7b96a821633d5b0ddd0f03fd68adf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748990664","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strip Miner takes the simple  loop of sandbox strip mining and turns it into a casual roguelike mining experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start every run just below the surface of a massive drill shaft, armed with your corporate-issued mining tool. Mine and deposit ores to afford items and upgrades to assist you.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don't forget to submit quota. Fail, and you will be forgotten. Succeed, and you receive a replenished corporate-issued tool, because only the best bots may continue digging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dev Note:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We're Team Morrow, a small group of college students just trying out this whole game dev thing. We really appreciate you for reading this, and maybe even checking out this little tech demo we made in our free-time. There's still a lot that needs to be done for Strip Miner, and we're here for it. Thank you again for checking out our page!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(p.s. Wishlist? :3)</p>","developers":["Morrow"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3686370","name":"Strip Miner"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785160/0e91771a7399bfd6b101e072464ff99c8242a404/header.jpg?t=1748990664","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257148076,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257148076/movie480.mp4?t=1748726127","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257148076/movie_max.mp4?t=1748726127"},"name":"Strip Min